{"id":1,"title":"Gnocchi-Pfanne mit Tomate & Mozzarella","description":"Knusprig gebratene Gnocchi, schnelle Tomatensauce, Mozzarella obendrauf. 20 Minuten, ein Topf weniger.","image_path":"/img/r1-3f359425500b.webp?h=hcylvccvz44&e=1792454400&s=E2JcV7RcIhzwH14Gi94i8OYLMpWXmIkG","source_type":"hellofresh","source_url":null,"servings":3,"time_min":20,"thermomix":false,"tags":["schnell","vegetarisch","Familie"],"steps":[{"text":"Zwiebel und Zucchini würfeln. Gnocchi in Öl goldbraun braten (ca. 6 Min.), herausnehmen."},{"text":"Zwiebel und Zucchini in derselben Pfanne anbraten, Tomaten zugeben, 5 Min. köcheln, salzen und pfeffern."},{"text":"Gnocchi unterheben, Mozzarella zerzupfen und darauf verteilen, abgedeckt 2 Min. schmelzen lassen."}],"favorite":true,"notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12 13:26:47","updated_at":"2026-10-12 13:26:47","ext_id":null,"image_url":null,"image_tries":0,"instructions_available":1,"nutrition":null,"collections":"[]","imported_at":null,"image_error":null,"image_local":true,"ingredients":[{"id":1,"recipe_id":1,"sort":0,"text":"500 g Gnocchi","qty":500,"unit":"g","product_id":32,"optional":0,"pantry":0,"section":null,"orig":null},{"id":2,"recipe_id":1,"sort":1,"text":"1 Dose stückige Tomaten","qty":1,"unit":"Dose","product_id":37,"optional":0,"pantry":0,"section":null,"orig":null},{"id":3,"recipe_id":1,"sort":2,"text":"1 Mozzarella","qty":1,"unit":null,"product_id":26,"optional":0,"pantry":0,"section":null,"orig":null},{"id":4,"recipe_id":1,"sort":3,"text":"1 Zucchini","qty":1,"unit":null,"product_id":48,"optional":0,"pantry":0,"section":null,"orig":null},{"id":5,"recipe_id":1,"sort":4,"text":"1 Zwiebel","qty":1,"unit":null,"product_id":50,"optional":0,"pantry":0,"section":null,"orig":null},{"id":6,"recipe_id":1,"sort":5,"text":"Olivenöl, Salz, Pfeffer","qty":null,"unit":null,"product_id":null,"optional":0,"pantry":1,"section":null,"orig":null}],"log":[{"id":1,"recipe_id":1,"cooked_at":"2026-09-30 13:26:47","actor":"Demo","rating":null,"note":